OL,3,GNEWSANo army bomb squad deployed to
OL,4,AOmagh before explosion, inquiry hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Omagh bomb inquiry has heard how
OL,7,Fbomb disposal experts were not deployed
OL,8,Fto the town before the explosion.
OL,10,FThis was despite an "accredited"
OL,11,Fcodeword warning, linked to other
OL,12,Fattacks, being received 35 minutes
OL,13,Fbefore the bomb blast, which killed 29
OL,14,Fpeople, including a woman pregnant with
OL,15,Ftwins.
OL,17,FBritish Army Colonel Peter MacMullan
OL,18,Fgave evidence to the inquiry about the
OL,19,Farmy's response to the warnings
OL,20,Freceived ahead of the blast.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,416,410,260,120,0,100
PN,41502
