OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSANo army bomb squad deployed to
OL,4,AOmagh before explosion, inquiry hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor a bomb squad to be sent, MacMullan
OL,7,Fsaid the Royal Ulster Constabulary
OL,8,F(RUC) would have had to request them,
OL,9,Fand that the response of the army was
OL,10,F"exactly in line with policies and
OL,11,Fprocedures" of the time.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
